{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 94228, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66514, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "火人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639403247, "updated_at": 1642428791, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1642428791, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升※标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突※黑色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显1.橙色摩根，NS给予木属性", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 4, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6126, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 94228, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">※</span>标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※黑</span>色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403394086_96323541.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403394086_96323541.png\"></div>1.橙色摩根，NS给予木属性敌方2体10秒出血（每秒100伤害），SS攻击500无视追伤&amp;出血中敌人追加500伤害，纯PVP人偶</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403504280_97359252.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403504280_97359252.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2.橙色提箱，NS给予敌方防御力-15%，SS给予敌方2体14秒出血（每2秒100伤害），队长技给予敌方全体防御力-10%，偏RDRB向人偶，全面增伤，建议给特蕾莎或者火人鱼，WB给火妈</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403978334_69655453.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403978334_69655453.png\"></div>3.紫色执事，SS45%几率给予出血中敌人2体12秒擦伤（出血持续时间增加），DS给予攻击力最高2体技能充能量+15%，PVP向人偶</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404137719_15450020.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404137719_15450020.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>4.紫色火护士，NS对木属性敌人追加250伤害，SS给予HP剩余最少敌方2体猛毒，偏PVP向天子，RDRB中可以给火刀稍微增加FT伤害</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404232563_15123902.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404232563_15123902.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>5.紫色梅芙，SS给予木属性敌人400追伤，队长技给予火属性我方NS最终伤害+7.5%，RDRB向人偶，但技能给的比较纠结，队长技适合给特蕾莎或火人鱼增加FT伤害，但是SS技能适合给火刀，如果下次对策是火刀队长技不错就给他</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404382565_26032006.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404382565_26032006.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>6.紫色骷髅，NS给予自身10秒内盾+1300，SS给予自身16秒反射（10%），偏PVP向人偶，RDRB中也可以给容易死的主打N的火天子给自己加盾</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404459209_39805812.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404459209_39805812.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>7.紫色火神，NS给予火属性我方2体10秒内盾+1300，SS给予火属性我方3体16秒内双刃剑，看不到具体数值，双刃剑随机给，只有NS的盾增加的生存有用</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404613277_33355196.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404613277_33355196.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>8.紫色火呆毛，SS给予敌方剩余HP最少2体14秒出血（每2秒70伤害），队长技给予火属性我方DS最终伤害+7.5%，PVP向，没什么卵用的人偶</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404726170_72173918.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639404726170_72173918.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">9.紫色熊妹，NS给予刀10秒攻击力+25%，队长技给予火属性队友攻击力+7.5%，偏RDRB向人偶，火队暂时没有攻击力加成辅助，给特蕾莎或者火人鱼，全面增伤，WB给火妈只吃队长技加成</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405085024_74937816.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405085024_74937816.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>10.蓝色尤娜，SS给予木属性敌人350追加伤害，给火刀增加点SS伤害聊胜于无</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405170223_66000756.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405170223_66000756.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>11.蓝色束缚，SS给予自身16秒盾+1150，RDRB中给容易死且主打S的火天子</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405291540_71375897.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405291540_71375897.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">12.蓝色架子鼓，DS给予攻击力最高我方2体20秒攻击力+22.5%，RDRB中给特蕾莎或者火人鱼稍微增加伤害</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405383244_80378344.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405383244_80378344.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>13.蓝色火炮，NS给予敌方225无视追加，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">RDRB中可以给火刀稍微增加FT伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405493183_37281210.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405493183_37281210.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>14.蓝色拔刀，NS给予木属性敌方225追加伤害，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">RDRB中可以给火刀稍微增加FT伤害</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405550315_92334058.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405550315_92334058.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">15.蓝色镰刀妹，队长技给予敌方全体防御力-5%，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB中可以给你的队长增加伤害，WB中给火妈或者新的对策队长增加伤害</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405964894_30773597.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639405964894_30773597.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>16.绿色魔龙，DS给予地方16秒防御力-5%，容易高加，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB中可以给你的DS天子稍微增加伤害</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406070053_26839422.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406070053_26839422.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">17.绿色发带，队长技给予火属性我方攻击力+4%，容易高加，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB中给特蕾莎或者火人鱼增加伤害，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">WB中给火妈或者新的对策队长增加伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406335391_72119478.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406335391_72119478.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>18.绿色火护士，SS给予HP剩余最少1体+900即时回复，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">容易高加，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB中给主打S天子增加队伍生存</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406502891_35275737.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406502891_35275737.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>19.白色火气球，DS给予敌方防御力-2%，容易高加，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">R<span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DRB中给<span>特蕾莎或者火人鱼稍微增加点伤害</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406577644_85503564.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406577644_85503564.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div>20.白色火大眼，SS给予火属性我方16秒盾+800，容易高加，随机火属性套盾，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">RDRB中给主打S天子稍微增加队伍生存</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406648154_53055664.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406648154_53055664.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">21.白色金币箱子，SS给予敌方12秒内防御力-2%，满破-12%，容易高加，没有提箱第一时间拉满，木RD的神人偶，给火弓增加全队输出，WB没用</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406784470_79329320.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639406784470_79329320.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">22.白色兔子，队长技给予火属性我方NS攻击力+3%，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">容易高加，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">RDRB中给特蕾莎或者火人鱼增加伤害，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">WB中给火妈或者新的对策队长增加伤害</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/862842.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}], "reward": {"user_count": 0, "last_user_list": null}, "content_tj_eq": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_lineup": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "content_1": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_eq_cdn": "", "content_tj_lineup_cdn": "", "content_live